k-reads/emerging-opportunities-for-farmers-and-research\",\"_key\":\"b76bd533792c\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"b76bd533792c\"],\"text\":\"Emerging opportunities for farmers - and research\",\"_key\":\"5b3d1f5ddfa9\"}]},{\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://adaptationatlas.cgiar.org/quick-reads/options-for-adaptation\",\"_key\":\"5668433acd1f\"}],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Options for adaptation\",\"_key\":\"c3ea244d8c0e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"5668433acd1f\"]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"2adaf7eef74f\"},{\"markDefs\":[{\"href\":\"https://adaptationatlas.cgiar.org/quick-reads/a-last-resort-switching-to-alternative-crops\",\"_key\":\"9ad0d047da62\",\"_type\":\"link\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"9ad0d047da62\"],\"text\":\"A last resort: switching to alternative crops \",\"_key\":\"65393793403d\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"3eaf92004c87\"},{\"children\":[{\"marks\":[\"d2b28757f604\"],\"text\":\"Data deserts and data jungles\",\"_key\":\"a8956bd5d572\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"c3f4a08922e6\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://adaptationatlas.cgiar.org/quick-reads/data-deserts-and-data-jungles\",\"_key\":\"d2b28757f604\"}]}],\"content1\":[{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Drought will threaten 43% of Kenya’s maize value of production in 2050\",\"_key\":\"ca3c70a5a2fc0\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"a7431a60556d\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Using organic fertilizer can increase common bean yields on average nearly 0.5 Mg/ha in the humid tropics\",\"_key\":\"fe47683615d00\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"8f2bfea8ee32\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"bde1a6185ccf\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Across Burkina Faso, Nord has the highest number of women working in agriculture and high levels of crop heat stress\",\"_key\":\"2649c08aa04a0\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Heat will cause unsafe working conditions for 78 million people assuming moderate emissions\",\"_key\":\"cce406f9a4030\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"1f0ddfb4b6ca\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"_key\":\"aa8c70c8dd94\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Livestock investments should target Ethiopia, Nigeria, Sudan, and Kenya for greatest adaptation and mitigation potential\",\"_key\":\"9725b70d7def0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"title2\":\"USE CASES\"},\"_id\":\"home\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-15T21:53:33Z\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore Tools\",\"heroImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/dfd85fa0bf8508e6c84ffc2ad6eefec1bb06fe58-704x501.svg\",\"howToUse\":{\"description\":\"Explore how to navigate the Atlas and learn how to contribute.\",\"video\":{\"embedCode\":\"\\u003cdiv style=\\\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ciframe src=\\\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1004131251?badge=0\\u0026amp;autopause=0\\u0026amp;player_id=0\\u0026amp;app_id=58479\\u0026amp;autoplay=1\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\\\" title=\\\"Africa Agriculture Adaptation Atlas - 'How To Use \\u0026amp; Participate' Video\\\"\\u003e\\u003c/iframe\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cscript src=\\\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\\\"\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"height\":1080,\"src\":\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1004131251?badge=0\\u0026amp;autopause=0\\u0026amp;player_id=0\\u0026amp;app_id=58479\\u0026amp;autoplay=1\",\"width\":1920},\"title\":\"How to Use \\u0026 Participate\"},\"tout\":{\"featuredImageAlt\":\"Landing page, Get Involved: A man using a chalk board to log project metrics\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/98372d81e415d345c9729f8bed5f57f174cffbbe-1560x1036.jpg\",\"subtitle\":\"The Africa Agriculture Adaptation Atlas is a community effort.\",\"descriptionHeader\":\"Want to contribute?\",\"title\":\"Get Involved\",\"buttonLabel\":\"Learn how\",\"descriptionBody\":\"Do you possess data that could aid others in addressing their queries regarding agricultural adaptation? Are you seeking answers to support adaptation programming? Join us in creating compelling, data-driven narratives that resolve real-world questions and fast-track adaptation efforts. Let’s collaborate!\"},\"search\":{\"menuTitle\":\"Search\",\"noResultsMessage\":\"No results found\",\"placeholder\":\"Search for evidence-based research and data by keyword or phrase…\",\"placeholderShort\":\"Search by keyword…\",\"title\":\"Find specific information quickly\"},\"spotlightCarousel\":{\"counterLabel\":\"of\",\"kicker\":\"Discover\",\"buttonLabel\":\"Explore data exploration\"},\"introText\":\"Data-rich tools for planning climate adaptation investments and policies\",\"subTitle\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d3f06476adc6\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Atlas community connects scientific knowledge to practical applications. Its interactive data explorations offer \",\"_key\":\"9892564d528e\"},{\"text\":\"policymakers, researchers, \",\"_key\":\"d5c8ebc2a607\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"]},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"and \",\"_key\":\"5f367f339323\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"investors \",\"_key\":\"cabf91506b6f\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"insights into climate risks, impacts, vulnerability, and adaptation strategies. \",\"_key\":\"c7b167f413c8\"}]}]},\"ms\":29}"
