          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 3658,
            "text": "{\"result\":{\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-05T21:26:06Z\",\"title\":\"Get Involved\",\"slug\":\"get-involved\",\"content\":[{\"_key\":\"d3a7359f4e1f\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Let’s Strengthen Adaptation Programming Together\",\"_key\":\"61d7d042716b0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"c06f6eb8e1c3\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"At the heart of the Africa Agriculture Adaptation Atlas is a foundational belief: none of us are smarter than all of us. Rooted in the diverse experiences and expertise of the climate, agriculture, research, and development communities, we aim to aggregate and amplify the most impactful data and insights to foster effective climate adaptation strategies across Africa. Building the community is a pathway to facilitate a seamless connection between those possessing valuable data and insights and the decision-makers seeking answers to their critical questions.\",\"_key\":\"53f21ffd6c8b0\"}]},{\"_type\":\"image\",\"alt\":\"Get Involved page, Featured Image: Three men walking on agricultural fields in Ethiopia\",\"caption\":[{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cf7010a50d53\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Image Credit:\"},{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" ©2015CIAT/GeorginaSmith\",\"_key\":\"3b86f2c35872\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"1861dd7ab466\"}],\"_key\":\"28c22f6106a0\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-0857f25a3ddc3835997a65e1d8675d887ab8fb1f-1560x1028-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},{\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"96acfcc0b6c7\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"How to Contribute\",\"_key\":\"fe3d7cd9854f\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"We are always looking for new information to incorporate into the Atlas, new questions to answer, and feedback on how we can do better, please \",\"_key\":\"5322660f04840\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"be5aac6abe78\"],\"text\":\"contact us\",\"_key\":\"081672d3944e\"},{\"_key\":\"f0ce0f7c7999\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". There are multiple ways to get involved: Create a Data Exploration to be hosted on the Atlas, Fork Spin-off Data Explorations and adapt them using your own data or modifying them to answer your questions.\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"a13a1da7d3f9\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"mailto:p.steward@cgiar.org\",\"_key\":\"be5aac6abe78\"}]},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"6352facbe317\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Create a Data Exploration\",\"_key\":\"990f0b4a12ea0\"}]},{\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"We call our interactive narratives with data explorations. These are topic-based investigations into a specific aspect of climate adaptation, aiming to communicate concepts and provide visitors with information to make real-world adaptation decisions. They are made in \",\"_key\":\"d40e64e25ca70\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"marks\":[\"947ffdcd3bf2\"],\"text\":\"Observable\",\"_key\":\"6185205bdd75\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", a collaborative platform for data exploration and visualization.\",\"_key\":\"bae4be5aa801\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"cdf671d3cae0\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"947ffdcd3bf2\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://observablehq.com/\"}]},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"ae12eb2f2431\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Creating a Data Exploration on your own is a multi-step process.\",\"_key\":\"b3218f0d9bc1\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"fc8c8cdbc45d\",\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Generate a data narrative.\",\"_key\":\"18bda7bd044d\"},{\"_key\":\"bb35d28ce80f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" What insights do you want to provide with your data? How should the user be guided towards these insights? Will this data and analysis fit within an existing notebook or should it be a standalone piece? Who is this notebook for/what is the target audience?\"}]},{\"markDefs\":[{\"href\":\"https://radiantearth.github.io/stac-browser/#/external/digital-atlas.s3.amazonaws.com/stac/public_stac/catalog.json\",\"_key\":\"7607a0e750bc\",\"_type\":\"link\"}],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Understand the data and prepare it for visualization.\",\"_key\":\"da18908c7c5c\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" List and describe the data sources and pre-processing requirements needed, and determine the plan for data storage, management, and quality-control. Explore the \",\"_key\":\"5901a748a897\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"text\":\"STAC\",\"_key\":\"96c2715f2cfa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"7607a0e750bc\"]},{\"text\":\" to find any other useful data sources which may allow further insights to be gained from your data.\",\"_key\":\"0689764bc54d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"cf3008391f74\",\"listItem\":\"number\"},{\"_key\":\"7a4aa9fa5925\",\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Stay organized by creating a data specification sheet.\",\"_key\":\"3a79cb5b8e86\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"]},{\"_key\":\"a5891b6f3ccc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Find out what data is needed, what analysis needs to be done beforehand, and determine the plots, maps, and what interactive selections (e.g., filters, sliders, drop downs) will be included to enhance the user experience without providing too many options. Understand the limitations and requirements of developing a performant notebook.\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"aa569479805c\",\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://observablehq.com/d/ffcfa914e30d6e5a\",\"_key\":\"8cc92c707c1c\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Build the notebook.\",\"_key\":\"03c87391b5da\"},{\"_key\":\"99961db9e6e2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Use our \"},{\"marks\":[\"8cc92c707c1c\"],\"text\":\"Data Exploration guidelines\",\"_key\":\"fe1907771c231\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"_key\":\"fe1907771c232\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" for our CSS style sheet and data management practices, and notebook tools and helpers.\"}],\"level\":1},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b0a82d3c57c7\",\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"666e5e003f02\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Ask for feedback from the Atlas team.\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" We’d gladly provide feedback and input to help you create an insightful data exploration.\",\"_key\":\"ee8cd7965ed2\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"And lastly, see your data come alive to provide impactful insights to users!\",\"_key\":\"6d5ee6ad5aab\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"e6cd2144ce23\",\"listItem\":\"number\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"af86d1357d87\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"mailto:p.steward@cgiar.org\",\"_key\":\"5b14cc56c6aa\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Have an idea or data for a Data Exploration but need help putting it into practice? Our team might be able to help. \",\"_key\":\"d3c7443b69720\"},{\"text\":\"Let us know\",\"_key\":\"d3c7443b69721\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"5b14cc56c6aa\"]},{\"_key\":\"d3c7443b69722\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" by sending us your idea and a work plan, and we can discuss incorporating it into the Atlas! We’ll work together to determine what you plan to contribute and what we might be able to provide.\"}]},{\"caption\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d4fdc3bf9b3c\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5c6739cbe9d9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Image Credit:\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" ©2013CIAT/NeilPalmer\",\"_key\":\"20dffa00cd4f\"}]}],\"_key\":\"2116bdd7223c\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-95fb4daa5c030ea2fa5bb871f8278698c2fd2534-1560x1034-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"_type\":\"image\",\"alt\":\"Get Involved page, Featured Image: Man showing gorilla bean harvest in DR Congo\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Create your own Spin-offs\",\"_key\":\"365ef0b24479\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"db0e90408262\"},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"7a81704602a5\",\"markDefs\":[{\"href\":\"https://observablehq.com/\",\"_key\":\"dbdeebee5fce\",\"_type\":\"link\"},{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://observablehq.com/documentation/notebooks/forking\",\"_key\":\"af025e8a12e3\"},{\"href\":\"mailto:p.steward@cgiar.org\",\"_key\":\"6b6777c5ebf9\",\"_type\":\"link\"}],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"63ff7a79ace80\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"We used \"},{\"text\":\"Observable\",\"_key\":\"d7f1998fbe31\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"dbdeebee5fce\"]},{\"_key\":\"060e69994d59\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" specifically to make it easier to reuse and adapt our work. If you like the data story and look of a Data Exploration but want to use your own data, \"},{\"_key\":\"861b96e06b22\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"af025e8a12e3\"],\"text\":\"Fork\"},{\"_key\":\"1c1a3349c6a1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" our Data Explorations directly from the Observable site and use it as a template inserting your own data. If you want to make your own Atlas website, we’re happy to share the Atlas’ codebase. Please \"},{\"marks\":[\"6b6777c5ebf9\"],\"text\":\"reach out to us\",\"_key\":\"6885d857a2e7\",\"_type\":\"span\"},{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to learn about the process we used.\",\"_key\":\"0d6f282e3a5f\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"_key\":\"6d02fe289e4d\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Use our Data\",\"_key\":\"3985ae8c6fc40\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"markDefs\":[{\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://radiantearth.github.io/stac-browser/#/external/digital-atlas.s3.amazonaws.com/stac/public_stac/catalog.json\",\"_key\":\"b87c15f1c76a\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"All of the data used in the Atlas is available through our online \",\"_key\":\"44066d50fb760\"},{\"_key\":\"e19cfad53cc7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"b87c15f1c76a\"],\"text\":\"SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (STAC). Download part or all based on your needs. Data used to make specific visualizations can be downloaded directly from the Observable page, look for the paperclip ‘file attachments’ in the top right of the browser window.\",\"_key\":\"cf37464dedf5\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"e99dc8416f52\"},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"f3d3730ad088\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Interested in showing others how you use the Adaptation Atlas? Reach out to us about writing an Atlas Use Case! We love to see the Atlas in action, and it’s an opportunity to share your work to a wider audience while inspiring others with innovative ways of using the Atlas.\",\"_key\":\"891359bdf5b30\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Stay in the Know\",\"_key\":\"1b5b65e884cc0\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"c7077e2c6b6e\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"2fde21718789\",\"markDefs\":[{\"href\":\"mailto:p.steward@cgiar.org\",\"_key\":\"35193ca2d558\",\"_type\":\"link\"}],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Interested in what we’re doing with the Atlas but don’t have anything specific to add just yet? Request to be put on \",\"_key\":\"762c535221ad0\"},{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"35193ca2d558\"],\"text\":\"our mailing list\",\"_key\":\"e5ebb324277f\"},{\"_key\":\"045c6803a0fb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to stay up to date with what we’re working on. We would love to hear if anything catches your interest.\"}]}],\"_id\":\"getInvolved\"},\"ms\":20}"
          },
