            "text": "{\"result\":[{\"comingSoon\":false,\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/a8756810a4d77cb4928d26952b8a6abbb3d6cf74-1560x1071.jpg\",\"slug\":\"evaluate-climate-risks\",\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\",\"name\":\"Exposure\"},{\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\"}}],\"_id\":\"3183ac0a-9746-4462-aefe-21ca004536bb\",\"secondaryTags\":[{\"name\":\"Risk\",\"_id\":\"58596c78-8cbb-4f54-9a79-2c2b369f8f8c\"},{\"name\":\"Vulnerability\",\"_id\":\"cd9fa965-6b24-4995-b90e-4d91e3d1e9a4\"},{\"name\":\"Value of Production\",\"_id\":\"69c2847a-4d0e-4f02-8104-33190a8177e6\"},{\"_id\":\"8b90cad3-152c-4f0b-92e7-e4f866149664\",\"name\":\"Crops\"},{\"_id\":\"fd554b8b-784f-4fd9-8993-bd160474f28c\",\"name\":\"Livestock\"},{\"_id\":\"3aa7d3e8-8454-461c-86dc-349502040f33\",\"name\":\"Prioritization\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/whatsAtRisk/notebook.html\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Gain context about the climate hazards for agricultural systems within your area of interest. See combinations of hot, dry, and wet climate hazards and the exposure of various crops and livestock. \",\"title\":\"Which crops and livestock are most exposed to climate-related hazards?\"},\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"hazards\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"name\":\"Exposure\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\"},{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\"},\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\"}],\"content\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"4e3885d9df45\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d69a53f687c7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\"}]},{\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2bb5a467141d0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The 'Evaluate Climate Risks' Data Exploration supports stakeholders in making informed decisions for targeting adaptation and resilience-building initiatives based on the exposure of crop and livestock to climate hazards. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"7b57e0dcb30b\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"94329ecf329c\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Visualize the value of production and rural populations across Sub-saharan Africa down to country sub-regions\",\"_key\":\"4ca98bf839010\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"64fcd748e7a6\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a6807d769c78\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Compare the exposure of crops and livestock to climate hazards\"}]},{\"_key\":\"991958b8aaf5\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Identify vulnerable communities using three adaptive capacity metrics - education, female empowerment, and poverty - that indicate the adaptability of a population to the threats of climate change on critical agricultural systems\",\"_key\":\"e93708d0e68f\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-08T20:32:58Z\",\"title\":\"Evaluate Climate Risks\"},{\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"a4707273-18b4-4efb-bd4c-2f083bc33dc6\",\"name\":\"Management Practices\"},{\"_id\":\"09c7b65b-de71-42e2-b4e2-ca10c7ced647\",\"name\":\"Benefits and Risks\"},{\"name\":\"Barriers to Adoption\",\"_id\":\"4fc626b6-9a6e-4578-bbce-6ced34c170cf\"},{\"_id\":\"e0abe2d1-58d5-468e-a992-9058e3f3baa3\",\"name\":\"Agroecological Zones\"},{\"_id\":\"c74bbffe-a437-437f-8dc6-eb3957627e0a\",\"name\":\"Production\"},{\"_id\":\"3698a977-a654-40b6-8567-8d2c4d39de18\",\"name\":\"Yield\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/solutions/notebook.html\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Gain insight into the range of practices applied to crops and the evidence supporting impacts on yield.\",\"title\":\"What interventions are most effective to increase production under various conditions?\"},\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-23T12:37:39Z\",\"title\":\"Discover Solutions\",\"upvotes\":0,\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/123bc85cfc912f2125c6ba72bdc532ff343bcf9f-1560x1040.jpg\",\"featuredTags\":[{\"name\":\"Responses\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"responses\"},\"_id\":\"1ca90184-e906-4102-bd9e-cac245b61a84\"},{\"_id\":\"e847ffae-f3a5-45fa-b8f2-ea7bbc82201e\",\"name\":\"Crops\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"crops\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"726273d7-9b34-4222-95e1-c796a793a590\",\"name\":\"Implementation\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"implementation\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"primaryTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"responses\"},\"_id\":\"1ca90184-e906-4102-bd9e-cac245b61a84\",\"name\":\"Responses\"},{\"_id\":\"e847ffae-f3a5-45fa-b8f2-ea7bbc82201e\",\"name\":\"Crops\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"crops\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"name\":\"Implementation\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"implementation\"},\"_id\":\"726273d7-9b34-4222-95e1-c796a793a590\"}],\"_id\":\"1fe2aab8-12fb-4d99-815f-ed5d4f274d14\",\"content\":[{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\",\"_key\":\"822063f6e9e8\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"95cc0b05a179\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"_key\":\"e5a3e3e2da43\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This Data Exploration supports stakeholders in making informed decisions about viable adaptation practices and considerations for implementation. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"dd44fe599488\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"eb3192bcd2ad\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"See an at-a-glance view of the breadth of research across adaptation practices\",\"_key\":\"c1d538e7905a\"}],\"level\":1},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Compare the range of practices used on specific crops, their average impact on crop yield, and the variability of practice impacts across different agroecological zones\",\"_key\":\"e30641510315\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d6f8f15e5ae2\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"_key\":\"10b913ba884b\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Assess the risk of negative outcome for practices applied to crops alone or in combination with other practices\",\"_key\":\"0fea0b5209ee\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"061fdc3374e3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Learn which factors impact adoption\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"78b058403d7a\"},{\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Access relevant guides to implement practices\",\"_key\":\"044a8bfee0dc\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"06d6b4eb2535\"}],\"slug\":\"discover-solutions\"},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/212d32f1876297030d3d3efd1b6d856e41b05d86-1357x1039.jpg\",\"content\":[{\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"aa067f8c5c04\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"95243b69dc4b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This Data Exploration explores the intersection of agriculture, climate change, and gender. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"5a0f92ffac950\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d414ef2a61dd\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Learn about the crops and agricultural practices in which women are most involved\",\"_key\":\"f0c28871b1a1\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"dedaec28793e\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Explore the different needs for gender-inclusive investments, in particular countries and regions\",\"_key\":\"670c423ce766\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"ee79d36ee064\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"3821ce9656ac\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c0b2a44d300a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"See the geographic relationship between heat stress and the amount of women involved in agriculture today\"}]}],\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"gender\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"9f3a1112-4517-48c7-8466-f7871dbdea63\",\"name\":\"Gender\"},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\"}],\"primaryTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"gender\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"9f3a1112-4517-48c7-8466-f7871dbdea63\",\"name\":\"Gender\"},{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"hazards\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\"}}],\"title\":\"Analyze Women’s Exposure to Climate Hazards\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"See where women are most agriculturally involved and how these areas will be affected by heat stress in the future.\",\"title\":\"Where will the issues of climate change and gender coincide in Sub-Saharan Africa?\"},\"slug\":\"analyze-womens-exposure-to-climate-hazards\",\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"18749454-95ee-49b2-a279-f92b7e731e9a\",\"name\":\"Women\"},{\"name\":\"Hotspots\",\"_id\":\"9a03a49d-22da-45d6-93e3-4026a60eab06\"},{\"_id\":\"cb7a184d-c626-47ec-b40a-d3c0f5bbb72b\",\"name\":\"Agency\"},{\"_id\":\"0b8f9564-acdf-4f98-8cd9-6e0288e24085\",\"name\":\"Empowerment\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooks/notebooks/gender/notebook.html\",\"_id\":\"a2f6e289-313f-4e71-8880-09b79a92e5f4\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-23T12:38:15Z\"},{\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"6df6c598-0a3d-42c4-b7e9-5c4d459b3b7a\",\"name\":\"Livestock\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"livestock\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"investments\"},\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\"},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-23T12:38:05Z\",\"_id\":\"8ee33480-3337-452e-89c8-e1259bb13d4e\",\"title\":\"Prioritize Livestock Investments\",\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"363d9ba2-39f0-44d1-bf81-67f047a75d9d\",\"name\":\"Geography\"},{\"_id\":\"69c2847a-4d0e-4f02-8104-33190a8177e6\",\"name\":\"Value of Production\"},{\"_id\":\"74e9f33d-e623-4772-9334-87cf330044f7\",\"name\":\"Economics\"},{\"name\":\"Barriers to Adoption\",\"_id\":\"4fc626b6-9a6e-4578-bbce-6ced34c170cf\"},{\"name\":\"Adaptation\",\"_id\":\"e478041d-cefb-40cb-a57d-e12a62b49f3a\"},{\"name\":\"Mitigation\",\"_id\":\"03a000a2-7c85-4c30-99e7-0bdeba6d0685\"},{\"_id\":\"28528d8c-94c6-4b48-8539-d773094bd83a\",\"name\":\"Solutions\"},{\"_id\":\"ff37b304-06b1-426e-aa4d-cb1427344768\",\"name\":\"Responses\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/livestock-notebook/notebook.html\",\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"6df6c598-0a3d-42c4-b7e9-5c4d459b3b7a\",\"name\":\"Livestock\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"livestock\"}},{\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"content\":[{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\",\"_key\":\"6a0a60eef5e2\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"b62180fbe361\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This Data Exploration focuses on livestock, a critical component of economic and food production systems in Africa. Because livestock are both at risk from climate change and a source of it, it is important to not only consider strategies for adaptation, but also mitigation. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"562ee4abe44d0\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b1a1a937b4b7\",\"markDefs\":[]},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Explore the growth in different populations of livestock over time, along with their associated changes in Value of Production and Greenhouse Gas Emissions\",\"_key\":\"19878b38cb12\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b3cd49f15a26\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"_key\":\"af8ff9114ea1\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"See which countries would be most impactful to focus on given a particular weighting between adaptation and mitigation\",\"_key\":\"b926d705f04a\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b802822a1cfd\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Learn about specific, real-world solutions and the potential constraints to adopting them\",\"_key\":\"86220da95511\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}]}],\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Identify regions that require livestock-related interventions for climate change adaptation and mitigation, and learn about the effective strategies that are feasible in these areas.\",\"title\":\"Where should we focus livestock investment to best support adaptation and mitigation efforts?\"},\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/f4501eaeca267d8534ab7b182fe3d44ad438c77b-1560x1040.jpg\",\"slug\":\"prioritize-livestock-investments\"},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/a2011c5156b7ccfc0f141cb71bd71b95bdf6a5f1-1560x1040.jpg\",\"_id\":\"c8d356ea-a4c8-4e40-8544-e43f84c06749\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Explore potential financial outcomes of an investment.\",\"title\":\"What is the expected economic performance of an adaptation investment?\"},\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"a2bb5681-640d-48d7-9619-252a4ad6a9a6\",\"name\":\"Prioritization\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"prioritization\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"implementation\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"726273d7-9b34-4222-95e1-c796a793a590\",\"name\":\"Implementation\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooks/notebooks/roi/notebook.html\",\"content\":[{\"_key\":\"c0790ed450fa\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\",\"_key\":\"67e4a93166a90\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"f609f8975dfc\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The ‘Estimating Economic Returns on Adaptation’ Data Exploration helps users evaluate the potential benefits of an investment in an adaptation intervention. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"4a2d59e6072a0\",\"_type\":\"span\"}]},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Explore the effects of parameters like the agricultural practice, the commodities to apply it on, the country to apply it in, and more\",\"_key\":\"aff5e74c037d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"c1dbf67c0b18\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Reveal the projected returns on an invested amount through key indicators like the Internal Rate of Return, Benefit-Cost Ratio, and Net Present Value\",\"_key\":\"f50b8cc84a74\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d1d9596e2f87\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-23T12:37:50Z\",\"featuredTags\":[{\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\"},{\"_id\":\"a2bb5681-640d-48d7-9619-252a4ad6a9a6\",\"name\":\"Prioritization\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"prioritization\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"implementation\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"726273d7-9b34-4222-95e1-c796a793a590\",\"name\":\"Implementation\"}],\"title\":\"Estimate Economic Returns on Adaptation\",\"secondaryTags\":[{\"name\":\"Economics\",\"_id\":\"74e9f33d-e623-4772-9334-87cf330044f7\"},{\"name\":\"Finance\",\"_id\":\"80032f35-e371-48c7-b10f-1ff74b322e68\"},{\"name\":\"Return on Investment\",\"_id\":\"f722d529-a26c-4406-b602-02bcf94fe403\"},{\"_id\":\"363d9ba2-39f0-44d1-bf81-67f047a75d9d\",\"name\":\"Geography\"},{\"name\":\"Crops\",\"_id\":\"8b90cad3-152c-4f0b-92e7-e4f866149664\"},{\"_id\":\"fd554b8b-784f-4fd9-8993-bd160474f28c\",\"name\":\"Livestock\"}],\"slug\":\"estimate-economic-returns-on-adaptation\"},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/9516173fbd8bbf43d5f1943c1539b8eccc1be0e3-1560x1034.jpg\",\"upvotes\":0,\"slug\":\"understand-heat-stress-on-producers\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-04-01T21:41:08Z\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Explore the size of the agricultural workforce in Africa today and in the future, and see how projected heat stress will affect the amount they will be able to work safely.\",\"title\":\"How will heat stress affect agricultural working conditions?\"},\"_id\":\"a9ca87b1-d1ec-48e4-a942-b1b5abf31c2e\",\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"13341a00-ef64-4067-9b65-c517a4dc3685\",\"name\":\"Labour\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"labour\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"b75173e9-b0e6-48d1-bba3-262b47471729\",\"name\":\"Heat Stress\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"heat-stress\"}},{\"_id\":\"9b08ebf8-9f22-46de-9224-883253b72281\",\"name\":\"Projections\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"projections\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"363d9ba2-39f0-44d1-bf81-67f047a75d9d\",\"name\":\"Geography\"},{\"name\":\"Harvest\",\"_id\":\"c01c093b-fb00-4c23-9adb-ba1c651d54c0\"},{\"_id\":\"77a729cf-515c-44ae-a6fb-a931e93dd49a\",\"name\":\"Structural Change\"},{\"name\":\"Climate Justice\",\"_id\":\"3d733224-ae5d-4f3c-b5f2-e2dccf737b89\"},{\"name\":\"Adaptation\",\"_id\":\"e478041d-cefb-40cb-a57d-e12a62b49f3a\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/heatstressProducers/notebook.html\",\"title\":\"Understand Heat Stress on Producers\",\"content\":[{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Overview\",\"_key\":\"700b014f247d0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"7444a0e25f73\"},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b3cfea896cd2\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The ‘Understand Heat Stress on Producers’ Data Exploration provides critical data to make informed decisions for targeting geographically explicit adaptation for the agricultural workforce. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"2b4d64393314\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Visualize the size of the African agricultural workforce today and in the future based on projected economic and social development trajectories\",\"_key\":\"de6cb282dfc80\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"e0aa4ef255ed\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Identify the heat stress exposure to different geographies under different climate projections against a baseline\",\"_key\":\"c3803ae864560\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"b81a8eea5023\"},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"461530134fb4\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Assess the proportion of the hours during growing season that will surpass safe working conditions for different populations\",\"_key\":\"6cf4c46f530c0\"}]}],\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"labour\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"13341a00-ef64-4067-9b65-c517a4dc3685\",\"name\":\"Labour\"},{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"heat-stress\"},\"_id\":\"b75173e9-b0e6-48d1-bba3-262b47471729\",\"name\":\"Heat Stress\"},{\"_id\":\"9b08ebf8-9f22-46de-9224-883253b72281\",\"name\":\"Projections\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"projections\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}]},{\"upvotes\":18,\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"09ca31f7-e015-4524-b0c8-78950a53c60f\",\"name\":\"Crop Models\"},{\"_id\":\"28528d8c-94c6-4b48-8539-d773094bd83a\",\"name\":\"Solutions\"},{\"_id\":\"3836a8f6-a22b-4feb-9372-e8a60d412d86\",\"name\":\"Cereals\"},{\"_id\":\"11db2902-45d9-4632-a2f5-1c8d20f7e93c\",\"name\":\"Varieties\"},{\"name\":\"Cultivars\",\"_id\":\"f72e184e-496e-4dfe-b8c2-06f1fa6277ae\"},{\"name\":\"Irrigation\",\"_id\":\"adc7a222-0f41-4078-b476-4c20ec28c2c7\"},{\"_id\":\"ba08f63c-c52d-4830-a980-f6679fe04927\",\"name\":\"Adaptation Options\"}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-22T16:57:47Z\",\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Explore the anticipated impacts of climate change on four major cereal crops—wheat, millet, maize, and sorghum—both with and without adaptation strategies by location. Then drill down to look at the relative adaptation benefits for key options including: changing varieties or irrigation.\",\"title\":\"What are the projected climate change impacts and adaptation benefits for cereals crops in Africa?\"},\"content\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"h2\",\"_key\":\"dcc6b51d7c19\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Overview\",\"_key\":\"bfe850eee494\"}]},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"f95e394052d4\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Cereal grains provide 50% of the daily caloric intake in sub-Saharan Africa. By 2050, the population of this region will more than double, and they will need to grow food on the same amount of arable land. Adaptation is crucial to evade the dire consequences of climate change on this increasingly important food supply. Use this Observable Notebook data tool to:\",\"_key\":\"85f14db48ee0\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"_key\":\"d0878571ba27\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Explore the impact of climate change on key crops in sub-Saharan Africa compared to other parts of the world\",\"_key\":\"dbbd83402bfc0\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"0448aae3b212\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Analyze specific projected changes to crops within particular sub-Saharan African countries and regions within them\",\"_key\":\"d28fea6f45dd0\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1},{\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Learn to what degree specific adaptation solutions can mitigate these changes\",\"_key\":\"25583f51ce430\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d510591af73c\"}],\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"crops\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"e847ffae-f3a5-45fa-b8f2-ea7bbc82201e\",\"name\":\"Crops\"},{\"_id\":\"7262fa5c-469d-4e64-bcf1-a1300e7092bb\",\"name\":\"Impacts\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"impacts\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"1ca90184-e906-4102-bd9e-cac245b61a84\",\"name\":\"Responses\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"responses\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"e847ffae-f3a5-45fa-b8f2-ea7bbc82201e\",\"name\":\"Crops\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"crops\"}},{\"name\":\"Impacts\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"impacts\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"7262fa5c-469d-4e64-bcf1-a1300e7092bb\"},{\"name\":\"Responses\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"responses\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"1ca90184-e906-4102-bd9e-cac245b61a84\"}],\"_id\":\"78b36032-2778-40a5-8b9c-6f1a47ed84a1\",\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/projectedImpacts/notebook.html\",\"comingSoon\":false,\"slug\":\"view-projected-climate-impacts\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/2de1d8f751bfaadcd1ed2e9ab990f61a5e4bf4cd-1560x1041.jpg\",\"title\":\"View Projected Climate Impacts \"},{\"_createdAt\":\"2024-08-30T20:52:56Z\",\"comingSoon\":false,\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\",\"name\":\"Exposure\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"prototype\":false,\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooksV1/notebooks/explore/notebook.html\",\"content\":[{\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This data exploration tool enables exploration and download of the data that underpins the Africa Agricultural Adaptation Atlas. The tool provides a platform for stakeholders to visualize and download data for their own analysis and insights. The tool can be used to discover patterns between datasets, countries, and regions. Use this Observable Notebook to:\",\"_key\":\"29357ecc3ea40\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"dc3595b63fe9\"},{\"_key\":\"7734379104d3\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9b1c0f8b12aa0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Gain in-depth insights into climate risk variables using the integrated table and plot tools.\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Filter and export data across variables and regions of interest for external analysis in multiple formats.\",\"_key\":\"0a8f0e18535b0\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"10573a5395f9\"},{\"_key\":\"9956f7f3cfde\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Visualize data to uncover valuable insights into spatial patterns of climate risk within and between countries.\",\"_key\":\"5b818bf2c1010\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"465d819fa97c\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Learn how to access our Spatio Temporal Asset Catalog STAC catalog to access the raw data.\",\"_key\":\"f73173f1c4ee0\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"_id\":\"7347a7a8-af1f-4161-94c0-45de2f563858\",\"title\":\"Explore the Datasets\",\"slug\":\"explore-the-datasets\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/5b73d68b7d49a2d5dab9c03fd199a4a8b3eed457-1600x1067.jpg\",\"primaryTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\",\"name\":\"Exposure\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"secondaryTags\":[{\"name\":\"Projections\",\"_id\":\"de303226-0374-4fde-aed7-b048d94a834a\"},{\"name\":\"Gender\",\"_id\":\"a57b36dc-353a-41d0-ad5b-cf607342171b\"},{\"name\":\"Climate\",\"_id\":\"22aeb3c6-8d4a-469d-a763-2122741616b6\"},{\"_id\":\"58596c78-8cbb-4f54-9a79-2c2b369f8f8c\",\"name\":\"Risk\"},{\"_id\":\"cd9fa965-6b24-4995-b90e-4d91e3d1e9a4\",\"name\":\"Vulnerability\"},{\"_id\":\"363d9ba2-39f0-44d1-bf81-67f047a75d9d\",\"name\":\"Geography\"}],\"upvotes\":24},{\"url\":\"https://observablehq.com/d/121ced9e71e73dbc\",\"content\":[{\"_key\":\"01348ccda3de\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"This data exploration tool supports stakeholders in developing a robust climate rationale, providing an evidence base to understanding the climate risks and selecting related solutions for a project or investment. The tool presents critical data points that illustrate the extent and impact of climate change on specific crops, livestock, and geographic regions, alongside possible response strategies. Use this Observable Notebook to:\",\"_key\":\"248088bc62fd0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"0dc782d1415a\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Access demographic and economic information for individual countries.\",\"_key\":\"7310a16555d00\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1},{\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"9a96e77e7419\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Analyze recent trends in key climate indicators, such as mean temperature.\",\"_key\":\"dae368dac222\"}]},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"735fd029133a\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c718a12493e8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Explore future climate projections under various scenarios of climate change severity.\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"13e99a3db238\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2fb6da784579\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Assess the vulnerability of specific crop and livestock groups to climate impacts.\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"ceb939cfb0f1\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Identify potential solutions to mitigate climate risks and enhance resilience.\\n\",\"_key\":\"9f58422bf30a\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\"},{\"children\":[{\"text\":\"This data exploration is a beta version and will be updated with additional data, features, and functionality.\",\"_key\":\"09e109d90617\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"d755fe010f9f\",\"markDefs\":[]}],\"upvotes\":55,\"carousel\":{\"description\":\"Explore a country and a sub-sector related to agriculture (crops, livestock, water resources) to get key graphs and brief interpretations to help build a climate rationale for your project.\",\"title\":\"How to formulate a compelling climate rationale for projects?\"},\"slug\":\"formulate-a-climate-rationale-for-projects\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/aa6ac839cc264961a218824eef5b8e298a6738f1-4146x2720.jpg\",\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"de303226-0374-4fde-aed7-b048d94a834a\",\"name\":\"Projections\"},{\"_id\":\"31f649ae-7bc4-4e71-892f-fb8839fd8125\",\"name\":\"Exposure\"},{\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"_id\":\"b9c8e441-7bf5-4867-83a4-7a4869ffb356\"},{\"_id\":\"3aa7d3e8-8454-461c-86dc-349502040f33\",\"name\":\"Prioritization\"},{\"_id\":\"1782ff10-e41b-422c-bf00-cad9f88dd026\",\"name\":\"Climate Rationale\"},{\"name\":\"Investments\",\"_id\":\"7031a744-6f2e-4ff5-987a-0cafb94e95b7\"}],\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"investments\"}},{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"solutions\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"9e65ed0e-dc8c-4778-8f9a-d487428621a3\"}],\"_id\":\"384610e2-52f3-4c45-a42e-afb48064e345\",\"comingSoon\":false,\"underMaintenance\":false,\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"hazards\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"solutions\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"9e65ed0e-dc8c-4778-8f9a-d487428621a3\",\"name\":\"Solutions\"}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-28T20:29:02Z\",\"title\":\"Formulate a Climate Rationale for Projects\"},{\"title\":\"Identify Vulnerability\",\"upvotes\":57,\"slug\":\"identify-vulnerability\",\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooks/notebooks/vulnerability/notebook.html\",\"content\":[{\"_key\":\"6ad56389e53d\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"This notebook integrates dimensions of urgency and adaptive capacity into a composite vulnerability index. The notebook combines indicators such as population density, crop exposure to climate hazards, poverty, education, and multiple adaptive capacity variables to identify areas where risks \\u0026 population sensitivity are high and the ability to respond is limited.\",\"_key\":\"fce10ea229c3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"bb7e86582146\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"text\":\"The notebook also includes gender-disaggregated sensitivity analysis, examining how poverty and education intersect for men and women within specific regions. It highlights the share of populations experiencing overlapping disadvantages, such as high poverty and low education.\",\"_key\":\"c81c61dac3ff\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[]}]}],\"primaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\"},{\"_id\":\"9f3a1112-4517-48c7-8466-f7871dbdea63\",\"name\":\"Gender\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"gender\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"comingSoon\":false,\"prototype\":false,\"featuredTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"adaptive-capacity\"},\"_id\":\"f64dbad2-e40e-45f0-9318-8c8b46c3ef22\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\"},{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"gender\"},\"_id\":\"9f3a1112-4517-48c7-8466-f7871dbdea63\",\"name\":\"Gender\"}],\"_id\":\"9952fab5-350c-4f14-bef9-8603d56a7626\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-08-29T17:26:16Z\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/7993f1f807cb877b99b42b686ae5876d71d18383-1600x1063.jpg\"},{\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"prioritization\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"a2bb5681-640d-48d7-9619-252a4ad6a9a6\",\"name\":\"Prioritization\"}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooks/notebooks/cis/notebook.html\",\"content\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"3b9f85737658\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Reliable Climate Information Services (CIS) depend on a continuous chain of functions: observation, data agreement, prediction and usability. This notebook helps users identify where climate information is reliable enough to inform agricultural decisions and where weak data infrastructure could limit impact.\",\"_key\":\"45e20b6ab771\"}]}],\"_createdAt\":\"2026-03-04T18:49:39Z\",\"prototype\":false,\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/001695fd616ee3c79b9e81e740cd4e4e48f43cdb-2048x1330.jpg\",\"title\":\"Climate Information Readiness\",\"slug\":\"cis-readiness\",\"_id\":\"446d22b3-8e3e-4560-9836-b9e6f9230781\",\"upvotes\":0},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/aa6ac839cc264961a218824eef5b8e298a6738f1-4146x2720.jpg\",\"_createdAt\":\"2026-02-27T16:20:05Z\",\"prototype\":true,\"slug\":\"climate-rationale-v2\",\"content\":[{\"_key\":\"9e89be94b973\",\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"text\":\"This data exploration tool supports stakeholders in developing a robust climate rationale, providing an evidence base to understanding the climate risks and selecting related solutions for a project or investment. The tool presents critical data points that illustrate the extent and impact of climate change on specific crops, livestock, and geographic regions, alongside possible response strategies. Use this Observable Notebook to:\",\"_key\":\"9aea3543acc0\"}],\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"3aaccd3b0999\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"text\":\"Access demographic and economic information for individual countries.\",\"_key\":\"b3179afbe1f0\"}],\"level\":1},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"text\":\"Analyze recent trends in key climate indicators, such as mean temperature.\",\"_key\":\"64b12dae0d0b\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"a7410b53e947\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"_key\":\"e3ecee919492\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"text\":\"Explore future climate projections under various scenarios of climate change severity.\",\"_key\":\"7b5732f3b294\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"974e1b78473e\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Assess the vulnerability of specific crop and livestock groups to climate impacts.\",\"_key\":\"67ef1775d5c8\",\"_type\":\"span\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"text\":\"Identify potential solutions to mitigate climate risks and enhance resilience.\\n\",\"_key\":\"5b38b8154bd6\"}],\"level\":1,\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"921d37fbf0d1\",\"listItem\":\"bullet\"},{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"1ad99d18bd1f\",\"children\":[{\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"This data exploration is a beta version and will be updated with additional data, features, and functionality.\",\"_key\":\"f498262de20c\"}]}],\"secondaryTags\":[{\"_id\":\"de303226-0374-4fde-aed7-b048d94a834a\",\"name\":\"Projections\"},{\"_id\":\"31f649ae-7bc4-4e71-892f-fb8839fd8125\",\"name\":\"Exposure\"},{\"_id\":\"b9c8e441-7bf5-4867-83a4-7a4869ffb356\",\"name\":\"Adaptive Capacity\"},{\"name\":\"Prioritization\",\"_id\":\"3aa7d3e8-8454-461c-86dc-349502040f33\"},{\"_id\":\"1782ff10-e41b-422c-bf00-cad9f88dd026\",\"name\":\"Climate Rationale\"},{\"name\":\"Investments\",\"_id\":\"7031a744-6f2e-4ff5-987a-0cafb94e95b7\"}],\"carousel\":{\"_type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Explore a country and a sub-sector related to agriculture (crops, livestock, water resources) to get key graphs and brief interpretations to help build a climate rationale for your project.\",\"title\":\"How to formulate a compelling climate rationale for projects?\"},\"_id\":\"41166743-361d-4476-8c2b-7bf31bd61377\",\"upvotes\":55,\"primaryTags\":[{\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\"},{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"9e65ed0e-dc8c-4778-8f9a-d487428621a3\",\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"solutions\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"comingSoon\":false,\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"76c80111-f04f-4f08-bff3-f1504c86746f\",\"name\":\"Investments\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"investments\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"hazards\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\"},{\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"solutions\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"9e65ed0e-dc8c-4778-8f9a-d487428621a3\"}],\"title\":\"Climate Rationale V2\",\"underMaintenance\":false,\"url\":\"https://notebooks-climaterationale.adaptation-atlas-nb.pages.dev/notebooks/climateRationale/notebook\"},{\"slug\":\"climatePayouts\",\"title\":\"Climate Payouts to Smallholders\",\"content\":[{\"_type\":\"block\",\"style\":\"normal\",\"_key\":\"4a6d55daaa6f\",\"markDefs\":[],\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8e37e4e0e0de\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This tool analyzes how climate-driven extreme weather, particularly droughts and floods, affects farms and farmer livelihoods across Africa, with a focus on identifying where, how many, and which types of farms are most likely to experience losses now and in the future. Using farm size distributions, historical data, and climate model ensembles (CMIP6) under different emissions scenarios, it estimates the probability of loss and lost revenue by farm size and region, projects changes in the number of farms to 2050, and quantifies how many farms may require financial support following extreme events. The tool is designed to support policy and program planning by providing evidence on the scale and distribution of agricultural loss and damage, highlighting the particular vulnerability of smallholders, and informing the design of farmer assistance, insurance, adaptation, and risk-reduction strategies under climate change.\"}]}],\"url\":\"https://adaptationatlas.github.io/atlas_notebooks/notebooks/lossDamage/notebook.html\",\"upvotes\":0,\"prototype\":true,\"_id\":\"7e3324ed-f74f-4019-aeb1-b267b0da95c5\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/30c5dda7deaa0aed4356a4e5cb6201446e506e7f-1000x664.jpg\",\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"_id\":\"ff9a72cf-1da2-4c34-aa0b-5585547602d9\",\"name\":\"Projections\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"projections-fr\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"_createdAt\":\"2025-12-22T15:55:50Z\"},{\"primaryTags\":[{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\"},{\"name\":\"Exposure\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\"},{\"_id\":\"9cb49d42-59b2-4625-89e5-b8355518cdbd\",\"name\":\"Risk\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"risk\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-28T20:30:05Z\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/1023d3e0e61b930a4f29eff25be697b7cdfa6011-1560x1036.jpg\",\"featuredTags\":[{\"_id\":\"d4f0b388-28d1-4707-86cb-3c89d9903357\",\"name\":\"Hazards\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"hazards\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}},{\"slug\":{\"current\":\"exposure\",\"_type\":\"slug\"},\"_id\":\"91d5bc42-a1ce-4f74-89c5-ef4c6489eb44\",\"name\":\"Exposure\"},{\"_id\":\"9cb49d42-59b2-4625-89e5-b8355518cdbd\",\"name\":\"Risk\",\"slug\":{\"current\":\"risk\",\"_type\":\"slug\"}}],\"title\":\"Identify Common Climate Threats \",\"content\":[{\"ch