            "text": "{\"result\":[{\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-05T18:55:27Z\",\"title\":\"IUCN develops climate rationale for Green Climate Fund proposal with Atlas climate projections and  livestock data\",\"slug\":\"iucn-gcf\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/3ae14a83b579961ff71b1a319952e61e8e34e845-1560x891.jpg\",\"_id\":\"1371e7ea-bbfc-4dbe-9034-dfcbf5719cdc\"},{\"title\":\"Conducting a cost-benefit analysis of banana value chain interventions supported by Malawi’s Ministry of Agriculture\",\"slug\":\"malawi-banana-interventions\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/e6a891dcf30dbfd21e70d8b7cef29d294e079ad5-2048x1360.jpg\",\"_id\":\"1e408398-57fa-4ae4-93e0-1dfb237fb572\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T07:41:44Z\"},{\"_id\":\"5030b380-1a43-4118-8f2f-82f56f667f0b\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T08:18:30Z\",\"title\":\"Evaluating the adoption of Climate-Smart Agriculture (CSA) practices and their impacts on maize yields in Mozambique with a gender lens\",\"slug\":\"mozambique-gender-maize\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/3d896879184e949a0ff7519d2af7c9b6a4d3c642-1600x1068.jpg\"},{\"slug\":\"rwanda-irrigation-support\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/f05cb5d74ecce26a23ceb9cd48b5897e1487f0cf-2048x1365.jpg\",\"_id\":\"573a14f0-10fe-4ad3-889e-0f67517bd1ae\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T09:09:37Z\",\"title\":\"Using the Atlas to support small-scale irrigation planning in Rwanda and evaluate its effect on productivity and income\"},{\"title\":\"Applying the Atlas to evaluate the efficiency of banana value interventions by the Tanzanian Ministry of Agriculture\",\"slug\":\"tanzania-intervention-efficiency\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/848af40facfeb4b86cfa5159a8d15a3f250a821d-2048x1360.jpg\",\"_id\":\"5796eae9-7e3e-4a92-a46d-9043269b19e5\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T09:29:25Z\"},{\"slug\":\"africa-climate-policy\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/62039622a2d08eab8b1b3d66a2ec381a976ac9a4-2048x1342.jpg\",\"_id\":\"59faa8f5-919f-479c-af5c-dc995c03f8ef\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T10:19:24Z\",\"title\":\"Integrating the Atlas into climate policy-making processes across Africa, with a focus on LT-LEDS, NAPs, and NDCs, as well as enhancing parliamentary oversight and gender mainstreaming\"},{\"_createdAt\":\"2024-02-23T20:43:35Z\",\"title\":\"CGIAR takes strategic research portfolio decisions with Atlas’ hazard and response analytics \",\"slug\":\"cgiar-strategy\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/c776f67a3374e16dee5f8ff7262c363437e20372-1280x850.jpg\",\"_id\":\"627c2e89-15d9-4aab-9ada-b86cd2580265\"},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/ffb0af5eb5e2ced9ae71ac37fce3306db67ff771-2048x1360.jpg\",\"_id\":\"69bd9a18-9050-4d5f-90c1-eff8f1069114\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-19T13:26:29Z\",\"title\":\"Coalition led by University of Ghana evaluates agroforestry and soil health interventions to reduce heat stress impacts on maize and cocoa farmers\",\"slug\":\"ghana-agroforestry\"},{\"slug\":\"kenya-county-integration\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/60c4d7b0cbbae74ec19b48777e3316b423a99e47-2048x1360.jpg\",\"_id\":\"75429f7b-317d-4d5e-84bd-6e323f33c3bc\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T10:01:43Z\",\"title\":\"Enhancing the capacity of Kenyan county officers in navigating and utilizing the Atlas, strengthen the integration of climate adaptation into local planning, and co-develop knowledge products tailored to county needs\"},{\"_id\":\"7bb5679e-a6de-4e0d-9476-039cf113e607\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T09:46:57Z\",\"title\":\"Analyzing greenhouse gas emissions in Uganda's cattle value chain to inform climate-smart livestock policies\",\"slug\":\"uganda-livestock-policy\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/33f2a6d99100994d9ee5374644daf82b152f6b9c-2048x1365.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Kenyan county governments access data on locally relevant adaptation strategies\",\"slug\":\"government-kenya\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/25a6a49bc10643dbbc92cede4971f3b3b18c1a33-1560x1036.jpg\",\"_id\":\"7fe9a3fb-6fc1-4c75-92a8-78d50b1a7f85\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-05T18:54:43Z\"},{\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/e806984b2adc6146a69f46dac3ce86492c46f240-2048x1365.jpg\",\"_id\":\"c28657d3-a70d-4d72-b00a-750b78d277cf\",\"_createdAt\":\"2025-09-22T08:38:54Z\",\"title\":\"Assessing the effectiveness of climate policy in mitigating low yields and crop losses among vulnerable households in Nigeria\",\"slug\":\"nigeria-mitigating-losses\"},{\"_id\":\"43874bd9-d7e1-4554-bb04-7287fea7aa74\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-11T17:46:57Z\",\"title\":\"The World Bank assessed the viability of adaptation investments with a model integrated into the Atlas\",\"slug\":\"world-bank-aiccra\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/be046a77a3358ba3784f4d258f6285a768bac54c-1560x1033.jpg\"},{\"slug\":\"aaa-csaips\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/ec4170fc1028901d6328599249b2b9b2d9de059c-1560x1036.jpg\",\"_id\":\"46f5919a-ce13-4f10-9f4b-6f3a56828882\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-03-11T17:48:12Z\",\"title\":\"The AAA Initiative and partners developed national investment plans using Atlas data\"},{\"slug\":\"our-data-can-help\",\"featuredImage\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gukr2buh/production/fcaee318efb5605479fa5c53f1dab346c3c130c6-4288x2848.jpg\",\"_id\":\"bad166ef-e62b-4db1-be49-57af0849ef6e\",\"_createdAt\":\"2024-08-15T19:35:22Z\",\"title\":\"Our data can help NGOs, researchers, governments, international finance institutions, and you, too. It’s free. Start here.\"}],\"ms\":32}"
